@startuml
title SwapCampus Core Subgraph: Campus Service

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 80

hide methods
top to bottom direction

class "User" as User {
  +id
  +name
  +credit
}

class "Service Listing" as CampusServiceListing {
  +id
  +intent
  +title
  +amount
  +status
}

class "Service Image" as CampusServiceImage {
  +image
}

class "Service Order" as CampusServiceOrder {
  +id
  +status
  +note
  +amount
}

User -[hidden]down- CampusServiceListing
CampusServiceListing -[hidden]down- CampusServiceOrder
CampusServiceListing -[hidden]right- CampusServiceImage

User "1" -down- "0..*" CampusServiceListing : publishes / offers
CampusServiceListing "1" -down- "0..*" CampusServiceOrder : turns into
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" CampusServiceOrder : requester / provider
CampusServiceListing "1" -right- "0..*" CampusServiceImage : has

note right of CampusServiceListing
The listing is the
information layer.
It supports two-way
supply and demand.
end note

note right of CampusServiceOrder
The order is the
fulfillment layer.
It records matching
and completion.
Favorites and behavior
records are omitted.
end note

@enduml
